<title>USA: Key IMM currency futures post fresh daily highs.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency futures post fresh daily highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 14 - IMM currency futures were mixed and key contracts posted fresh daily highs midday. June Swiss francs creep into positive territory, yen moderately higher, marks cut losses and head near resistance at $0.5910. Traders cite ideas U.S. rate hike May 20 not certain. Sterling matches April 4 session high of $1.6438.</p>
